tation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stock</surname><given-names>KF</given-names></name><name><surname>Distl</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic correlations between osseous fragments in fetlock and hock joints, deforming arthropathy in hock joints and pathologic changes in the navicular bones of Warmblood riding horses</article-title><source>Livest Sci</source><year>2006</year><volume>105</volume><fpage>35</fpage><lpage>43</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.livsci.2006.04.027</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Stock</surname><given-names>KF</given-names></name><name><surname>Distl</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic analyses of radiographic appearance of the navicular bones in the Warmblood horse</article-title><source>Am J Vet Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>67</volume><fpage>1013</fpage><lpage>1019</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16740095</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2460/ajvr.67.6.1013</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Willms</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>R&#x000f6;he</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kalm</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetische Analyse von Merkmalskomplexen in der Reitpferdezucht unter Ber&#x000fc;cksichtigung von Gliedma&#x000df;enver&#x000e4;nderungen. 1. Mitteilung: Z&#x000fc;chterische Bedeutung von Gliedma&#x000df;enver&#x000e4;nderungen</article-title><source>Z&#x000fc;chtungskunde</source><year>1999</year><volume>71</volume><fpage>330</fpage><lpage>345</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Winter</surname><given-n